  "id": "walkthru-earth/opensensor-space",
  "title": "OpenSensor.Space",
  "description": "Continuous time-series environmental and weather readings from an IoT sensor network in the Cairo/Nile Delta region of Egypt. Data is collected via Raspberry Pi devices with Enviro+ sensors, capturing temperature, pressure, humidity, gas concentrations (oxidised, reducing, NH3), ambient light, and particulate matter (PM1, PM2.5, PM10) at multiple particle size fractions, partitioned by station and date. A companion asset provides geospatial suitability analysis for air quality monitoring station placement.",
  "license": "proprietary",
